{"id": "68596", "title": "重生之前妻别回家", "author": "糖果栗子", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68596.htm", "intro": "我死的时候，是个圣母。\r\n忍受婆婆虐待，前夫爱着别人。离婚拿不到一毛钱，不能要回女儿因为养不起。\r\n更悲催地是还得了绝症。\r\n我忍够了！虽然不知道为什么重生，但我确实重生了。\r\n既然再活一次，那就别怪我虐小三，虐前夫，与JP婆婆对抗。\r\n但是……为什么上辈子沦落为黄脸婆的我，会在重生后桃花不断？\r\n而且，尽是一堆烂桃花！\r\n\r\n内容标签：婚恋 高干 婆媳 小三", "base": "files/article/html/68/68596", "chapters": [{"title": "序", "file": "10537683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "10537684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10537685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10537686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10537687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-45", "file": "10537688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-57", "file": "10537689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-83", "file": "10537690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "84-87", "file": "10537691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "88-93", "file": "10537692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-99", "file": "10537693.html", "available": false}, {"title": "100-104", "file": "10537694.html", "available": false}, {"title": "105-109", "file": "10537695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "110-117", "file": "10537696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "118-121", "file": "10537697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10537698.html", "available": false}]}